    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d103">

                <pb facs="0218" n="102" sameAs="frus:frus1914/pg102"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 893.811/106.</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Minister Reinsch to the Secretary of State.</hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">American Legation</hi>, <lb/>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">Peking</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1914-01-30">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">January 30, 1914</hi></date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>The Minister for Foreign Affairs, Agriculture and Commerce to-day signed
                    memorandum giving the Red Cross one year in which to exercise good offices for
                    obtaining a loan to carry out Huai conservancy in the form reported in my
                    telegram of January 23.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Reinsch</hi></signed>.</closer>
            </div>
